	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「機動戦士ガンダムZZ」よりリック・ディアスの発展強化型MS“シュツルム・ディアス”がHGUCにラインナップ 特徴であるグライ・バインダーを初立体化、内面のメカディテールも細密に再現 頭部カバーは隊長機用と一般機用の2種類から選択可能 ビーム・ピストル×2、クレイ・バズーカが付属"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Mobile Suit GundamZZ\", Rick Diaz's developed and enhanced MS \"Sturm Diaz\" is now available in HGUC.Characteristics: The Gray Binder is made into a three-dimensional model for the first time, and the inner mechanical details are also minutely reproduced.The head cover can be selected from two types: for the captain's machine and for the general machine.Beam pistol x 2 and clay bazooka are included."
		]
